# Rasbperry Pi Provisioning

This repository holds configuration files for my Raspberry Pi, which is configured on first boot by [cloud-init](https://cloud-init.io/).


## Usage

Write an image with the Raspberry Pi Imager. Customize the image as always. Make sure to setup an internet connection (ethernet or wifi).

When written, go to the boot partition on the SD card. Rename `boot/firmware/user-data` to `boot/firmware/base.yaml`. Copy the `user-data` from this repository into `boot/firmware/`. Then open `boot/firmware/network-config` and set `optional` to `false`.